
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Placenta-Seg in your research, please cite this software."
type: software
title: "Placenta-Seg: Automated Placenta Segmentation from T2*-Weighted MRI"
abstract: >-
  Placenta-Seg provides a pretrained two-dimensional nnU-Net v2
  model for automated placenta segmentation from T2*-weighted
  magnetic resonance imaging. The software includes a Python
  inference application supporting BIDS-oriented datasets and
  five-fold ensemble prediction.
authors:
